Z||000000||jlruiz67||07-05-2000||11:01 PM||||Hello <BR>I like to know if anyone thinks this is a good price for a turbo. It seems that the kit is complete and is for 3,000 for an automatic Fiero. <P> <A HREF="http://www.designonesystems.com/turbo/index.html" TARGET=_blank>www.designonesystems.com/turbo/index.html</A> ||||reg||1
